          "Sample across the full observation window, including the days when the queue was busiest and the days when coverage changed. A second reviewer should re-extract a small subsample and record disagreements before the full analysis. Do not expand the sample only because the early result looks weak or strong. Include at least one case from each owner in scope when the frame allows it. Record this decision in the study log with the case key, the review date, and the person who approved the classification. The October 28 control note for Outsourced Company should name the timekeeping source, the owner, and the next review time.",
